NOTE ON THE FIRST-AID CONTENT

The MIT licence above covers the source code. The first-aid guidance in
src/data/flows/ was written by summarising publicly available protocols from
the NHS, the American Red Cross, St John Ambulance and the WHO; each flow file
names its sources with titles and URLs. Those organisations retain the rights
to their own published material, and none of them endorse, review or are
affiliated with this project.

This software has not been reviewed or approved by any medical authority. See
the disclaimer in README.md before using or distributing it.
